% Hernquist-sphere pure-gravity equilibrium test
% Code units: G = 1, M = 1, a = 1, half-mass radius r_h = 2.414.
% v_rms = sqrt(2 KE/M) = 0.408 (KE = -W/2 = GM^2/(12a)); half-mass crossing
% time t_cross = 2 r_h / v_rms ~= 11.83. TimeMax = 11.8 covers ~1 crossing.
%
% This was 118 (~10 crossings). Shortened 10x for suite wall time. What that costs is
% recorded here because it is not recoverable from the numbers alone: the secular
% signals this test was built to catch develop after t ~ 40, so a 1-crossing run sees
% the initial transient, not the late-time drift. In particular the periodic-gravity
% r_h runaway (see PERIODIC_RH_RUNAWAY_VARIANTS) reaches ~10% only near t=118 and is
% invisible here. Measured on the baseline variant, drift over t is NOT one power law:
%   |dE/E| ~ t^0.97   (secular)      -> shrinks ~9x   at 10% runtime
%   COM drift ~ t^0.58 (random walk) -> shrinks ~4.6x at 10% runtime
%   |dr_h/r_h|         oscillates    -> shrinks only ~2.7x, non-monotonically
% so the tolerances downstream are scaled per-quantity, NOT by a flat 10x.
% BoxSize = 500 = ~2 r_max, where r_max = 100 r_h is the IC truncation radius;
% sized so the cluster fits with its periodic image at the box-corner origin.
%
InitCondFile                       hernquist_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            11.8
BoxSize                            500
TimeBetSnapshot                    1.183
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBegin                          0
TimeBetStatistics                  1
MaxSizeTimestep                    1.0
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-9
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.005
ErrTolTheta                        0.5
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
CourantFac                         0.4
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.05
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 1
MaxMemSize                         2000
PartAllocFactor                    2.5
BufferSize                         100
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
UnitLength_in_cm                   1
UnitMass_in_g                      1
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s           1
GravityConstantInternal            1
Softening_Type0                    0.05
Softening_Type1                    0.01
Softening_Type2                    0.05
Softening_Type3                    0.05
Softening_Type4                    0.05
Softening_Type5                    0.05
Softening_Type0_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type1_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type2_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type3_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type4_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
Softening_Type5_MaxPhysLimit       0.05
AGS_DesNumNgb                      32
AGS_MaxNumNgbDeviation             1
